        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 years ago",
        "text": "Great place to picnic in the summer.  Bring a BBQ if you like.  The city often has activities for families going on both summer and winter.  Reasonably priced pedal boat and kayak rentals are available too.",
        "time": 1535072649,
        "translated": false
      },
